### Alta del envío con fecha estimada
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/operador/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":"evt-001","shipment_id":"SHP-123","status":"CREADO","timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:00:00-03:00","estimated_delivery_date":"2026-11-25T18:00:00-03:00"}

### Reenvío del mismo evento (responde "duplicado")
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/operador/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":"evt-001","shipment_id":"SHP-123","status":"CREADO","timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:00:00-03:00","estimated_delivery_date":"2026-11-25T18:00:00-03:00"}

### En distribución
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/operador/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":"evt-003","shipment_id":"SHP-123","status":"EN_DISTRIBUCION","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:00:00-03:00"}

### Llega tarde un evento anterior (responde "solo_historial")
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/operador/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":"evt-002","shipment_id":"SHP-123","status":"EN_TRANSITO","timestamp":"2026-11-23T15:00:00-03:00"}

### Estado actual
GET http://localhost:8080/envios/SHP-123

### Historial cronológico
GET http://localhost:8080/envios/SHP-123/eventos
